{"id":"incluso","lemma":"incluso","pos":"adv","rank":292,"glosses":["even","including"],"ipa":"/inˈkluso/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/40/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-incluso.wav","examples":[{"text":"Incluso Tom estaba desconcertado.","en":"Even Tom was baffled.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800986"},{"text":"Trabajo incluso los domingos.","en":"I work even on Sunday.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/116312"},{"text":"Me sentía incluso más pequeño.","en":"I felt even smaller.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636493"},{"text":"Me sentía incluso más pequeña.","en":"I felt even smaller.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1190550"},{"text":"Incluso Tomás tiene sus dudas.","en":"Even Tom has his doubts.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460958"}]}